Mail : info@rifugiodegliangeli.org
Site officiel: http://www.rifugiodegliangeli.org/', 'https://www.refuges.info/point/5432/refuge-garde/refuge-degli-Angeli-Ex-Scavarda/', '2023-06-01 15:20:08', '2026-09-30 12:00:39', NULL),
